WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.390
A man runs up to Jesus
and kneels in the road.

2
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:09.110
He asks: Good Teacher, what shall I
do that I may inherit eternal life?

3
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.660
He has kept the commandments
since his youth.

4
00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:15.810
And Mark says Jesus looked
at him and loved him.

5
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:19.160
Then Jesus tells him there
is one thing he lacks.

6
00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:21.310
The man walks away sad.

7
00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.330
So what was the price he would not pay?

8
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:29.080
In this mission, you'll see why Jesus
says that many who are first will be last,

9
00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:30.830
and the last first.

10
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:35.740
Then you'll find out why Jesus' answer
left his own disciples astonished.

11
00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:40.540
Your mission: find out what price Jesus
named for the good man who walked away

12
00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:41.250
sad.
